</span></span></span></span><span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;">6 </span><span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.6.2" class="ltx_text"><span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.6.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.6.2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1.6.2.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
